			<div class="col-sm-9">
				<p>
					Air in the atmosphere will enter a chamber where it is trapped between two spinning rotors. As the rotors spin
					in opposite directions, the stored air becomes set at a specific pressure level. Because this process is much
					less strenuous than a reciprocating air compressor, the machine is able to operate at a lower operating
					temperature. This also helps enable a rotary screw compressor to be operated 24/7
				</p>
				<p>
					Boosting your company's profits was the main goal that Ingersoll Rand had in mind when it designed the
